<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<!-- The baby and the room, generated from a single table of fractional positions.

    Every view is anchored to the parent with layout_constraint*_percent, because in
    ConstraintLayout a percentage is ALWAYS relative to the parent - never to the view it
    is constrained to. Anchoring everything to the parent keeps the artwork and the Java
    HitZones (which are built from these very views) on exactly the same coordinates, on
    any screen size. -->
